# Continuous Downloader

## Purpose

Monitors S3 in real-time and downloads new files as they arrive. Perfect for:
- Live video ingestion
- Real-time data pipelines
- Continuous monitoring

## Features

✅ **Auto-Discovery**
- Automatically finds latest year/month/day/hour
- Auto-advances to next hour when available
- Handles day/month/year transitions

✅ **Smart Monitoring**
- Configurable check interval (default: 90s)
- Lookback window for late arrivals
- Tracks download history (independent of filesystem)

✅ **Robust Tracking**
- Persistent history file (`.download_history.txt`)
- Works even if files are moved/deleted
- Thread-safe with file locking

✅ **Continuous Operation**
- Runs indefinitely
- Auto-recovery from errors
- Graceful hour transitions

---

## Installation

Same as one-time downloader, plus:

```bash
# Ensure flock is available (for thread-safe history)
which flock
```

