## Configuration

```bash
DOWNLOAD_DIR="./P_downloaded"         # Download destination
S3_BUCKET="anitum-jk-production"      # S3 bucket
LOCATION="nungambakkam"               # Location prefix
MAX_PARALLEL=10                        # Parallel downloads
CHECK_INTERVAL=90                      # Seconds between checks
LOOKBACK_FILES=20                      # Recent files window
