## File Naming Convention

### Expected Format

```
channel<NUM>_<TIMESTAMP>.mp4
│       │    │           │
│       │    │           └─ Extension
│       │    └───────────── YYYYMMDDTHHmmss
│       └────────────────── Channel number
└────────────────────────── Literal "channel"

Examples:
✓ channel401_20251114T190530.mp4
✓ channel1_20251114T000000.mp4
✓ channel9999_20251231T235959.mp4

✗ 401_20251114T190530.mp4        (missing "channel")
✗ channel401-20251114T190530.mp4 (wrong separator)
✗ channel401_2025-11-14.mp4      (wrong timestamp format)
```

